1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:02,549
Iklanmu untung atau rugi?

2
00:00:02,549 --> 00:00:04,355
Jangan tebak, hitung!

3
00:00:05,200 --> 00:00:09,678
Catat biaya iklan, Konektor
bandingkan dengan nilai closing.

4
00:00:09,678 --> 00:00:10,574
Itulah ROAS.

5
00:00:11,700 --> 00:00:15,370
Buka Biaya Iklan, lalu klik
Rekam Biaya Baru.

6
00:00:16,300 --> 00:00:19,051
Pilih platform, misalnya TikTok Ads.

7
00:00:19,051 --> 00:00:23,024
Isi jumlah dalam rupiah, pilih
tanggal, lalu simpan.

8
00:00:25,800 --> 00:00:26,896
Pakai Meta Ads?

9
00:00:26,896 --> 00:00:28,212
Nggak perlu ketik.

10
00:00:28,212 --> 00:00:31,355
Klik Kelola Koneksi, lalu
Tambah Akun Baru.

11
00:00:32,400 --> 00:00:34,258
Klik Sinkronisasi Sekarang.

12
00:00:34,258 --> 00:00:38,112
Biaya tujuh hari terakhir masuk
sendiri, lalu tiap hari.

13
00:00:39,200 --> 00:00:42,361
Ikon awan berarti sinkron otomatis.

14
00:00:42,361 --> 00:00:45,342
Ikon pensil berarti input manual.

15
00:00:46,150 --> 00:00:47,125
Buka Dashboard.

16
00:00:47,125 --> 00:00:49,466
ROAS per platform langsung terlihat!

17
00:00:51,550 --> 00:00:53,221
Angka beda dengan Meta?

18
00:00:53,221 --> 00:00:56,635
Sinkronkan lagi, lalu cek zona
waktu workspace.

19
00:00:58,150 --> 00:01:00,635
Catat biaya, lihat untungnya.

20
00:01:00,635 --> 00:01:03,206
Panduannya di konektor dot id.
